1
00:00:11,365 --> 00:00:14,452
FROM ME TO YOU 2ND SEASON

2
00:01:01,123 --> 00:01:03,834
THE PERSON THAT I LIKE

3
00:01:09,215 --> 00:01:13,385
The midterms for the
first term have now ended.

4
00:01:13,469 --> 00:01:15,387
Yes! My grades went up!

5
00:01:15,471 --> 00:01:16,847
Mine did too!

6
00:01:16,931 --> 00:01:19,266
All 'cause of Sadako's lecture!

7
00:01:19,350 --> 00:01:21,143
Thanks so much, seriously!

8
00:01:25,940 --> 00:01:29,443
It's almost time... for the school festival.

9
00:01:29,985 --> 00:01:32,404
- What's all this?
- Constipation? Diuretics?

10
00:01:32,488 --> 00:01:34,490
That's so scary!

11
00:01:34,949 --> 00:01:38,410
Apparently, a 2nd year named
Sadako Kuronuma is growing them.

12
00:01:38,494 --> 00:01:41,956
- Sadako?
- Oh I know her! I've seen her!

13
00:01:42,039 --> 00:01:48,629
- Oh c'mon Joe... what are you doing dude?
- No way! Like what? Tell me! For example...

14
00:01:50,422 --> 00:01:54,885
Uh, the theme for this year's
school festival will be... fantasy!

15
00:01:56,595 --> 00:02:01,767
With that in mind, I want to hear
your suggestions for our class program.

16
00:02:03,727 --> 00:02:07,231
- I really hope that I can participate too.
- I don't care what it is.

17
00:02:07,314 --> 00:02:10,401
Just hurry up and decide.

18
00:02:11,944 --> 00:02:15,489
Here! I got one! How about we
do a "Sadako's Black Magic Café"?

19
00:02:15,573 --> 00:02:17,783
Wait, black magic?

20
00:02:18,993 --> 00:02:22,705
She's even famous among the
first years, everyone'll come.

21
00:02:22,788 --> 00:02:26,292
Maybe we could brew some tea
with her weird weeds and serve that!

22
00:02:26,458 --> 00:02:29,628
What about setting up a booth
where people can go meet with her?

23
00:02:29,712 --> 00:02:32,715
Yeah! Like a fortune telling thing!

24
00:02:33,883 --> 00:02:36,010
Sawako is climbing
right up the social ladder.

25
00:02:36,093 --> 00:02:38,220
- Yup.
- Or something like the

26
00:02:38,304 --> 00:02:40,556
- night parade of demons?
- That'd be awesome!

27
00:02:41,348 --> 00:02:44,727
Okay! Then let's take a vote!

28
00:02:49,481 --> 00:02:52,818
- What's this?
- That one's called fish mint.

29
00:02:52,902 --> 00:02:56,488
- Ah... I've seen them make tea with that.
- Gotcha. And this?

30
00:02:56,572 --> 00:02:57,656
It's shiso.

31
00:02:57,740 --> 00:03:00,701
- Woah, you were growing that too?
- I figured it'd be good

32
00:03:00,784 --> 00:03:03,245
since it has so many uses...

33
00:03:03,329 --> 00:03:05,831
- OFF to ON] Nice shot Joe!
- Thanks, man!

34
00:03:05,915 --> 00:03:08,834
- Kazehaya and the guys...
- Kazehaya!

35
00:03:09,418 --> 00:03:13,339
Check it out! Sadako's been growing all
kinds of different herbs in the flower

36
00:03:13,422 --> 00:03:14,256
bed!

37
00:03:27,978 --> 00:03:28,812
Yeah.

38
00:03:40,324 --> 00:03:45,996
Hey, so, you think we can use
shiso somehow at our café? Sadako?

39
00:03:47,164 --> 00:03:51,418
- Yes. Like make tea with it or something?
- Oh! Yeah! Anything can be tea

40
00:03:51,502 --> 00:03:54,964
if you soak it in hot water.

41
00:03:55,631 --> 00:03:59,802
- Also, what's this one over here?
- Oh, that one is rosemary and...

42
00:04:01,512 --> 00:04:04,098
Rosemary? Isn't that a kind of
spice? I wonder if that could be tea too...

43
00:04:04,181 --> 00:04:06,767
I do want to talk to him... but I have no
idea what to say, so the words just won't

44
00:04:06,850 --> 00:04:09,270
- come out.
- Oh! That could be nice!

45
00:04:10,271 --> 00:04:14,233
Is it just me? Or has the
distance between us grown?

46
00:04:17,486 --> 00:04:20,781
That space... Am I the one who created it?

47
00:04:24,910 --> 00:04:28,831
Well, with Sawako, I know she's at least
trying her best to find a way to talk to

48
00:04:28,914 --> 00:04:32,835
him. But It just feels like he isn't
putting in the same effort, y'know like

49
00:04:32,918 --> 00:04:36,005
he's lost his enthusiasm.

50
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:40,217
I wonder if something happened.

51
00:04:40,301 --> 00:04:43,929
You might not be the closest to
her- you just haven't gotten past that.

52
00:04:44,054 --> 00:04:47,808
This is bad. Really bad. I need to
figure out a way to fix this somehow. Oh

53
00:04:47,891 --> 00:04:50,352
yeah! I'll use Ryu--

54
00:04:51,603 --> 00:04:55,274
So, Ryu... He is taking you with
him? It's happening Sunday, right?

55
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:57,609
The wedding.

56
00:04:57,693 --> 00:05:02,614
Oh, that? We're gonna pile
into Pop's car and zoooom there!

57
00:05:02,698 --> 00:05:07,494
Okay, what time are you
leaving? Around 7 o'clock, why...?

58
00:05:19,340 --> 00:05:23,969
How to apply gel eyeliner: Brush to fill
in the gaps between your eyelashes." When

59
00:05:24,053 --> 00:05:29,141
you get to the part above your
pupils, then make it a bit thicker.

60
00:05:29,224 --> 00:05:34,313
Let's see... "Draw the corner of the
eyes with a long downward stroke."

61
