Oops?

62
00:05:39,068 --> 00:05:44,198
Oh jeez. Now what did
you get yourself into?

63
00:05:44,990 --> 00:05:45,824
Y-Yano-chin!

64
00:05:47,451 --> 00:05:50,788
I-I'm begging you, can you
please help me? I-it's bad isn't it.

65
00:05:50,871 --> 00:05:54,083
I used to have a doll
that looked like that.

66
