Listen, Chii! No matter what,
you and I won't drift apart okay?

86
00:07:38,979 --> 00:07:39,855
Really?

87
00:07:42,191 --> 00:07:43,484
Of course. I promise.

88
00:07:49,239 --> 00:07:51,700
Toru, Haruka, congratulations.

89
00:08:31,657 --> 00:08:32,783
