90
00:08:37,037 --> 00:08:39,748
Here. It was a
beautiful wedding, wasn't it?

91
00:08:39,831 --> 00:08:40,666
Yeah.

92
00:08:44,336 --> 00:08:48,340
The summer tournament.
It's happening soon, right?

93
00:08:48,423 --> 00:08:52,386
It's gonna be right
after the school festival.

94
00:08:52,469 --> 00:08:55,597
- Do your best! Win it this time!
- So, what's up?

95
00:08:58,684 --> 00:08:59,518
Go on.

96
00:09:02,813 --> 00:09:05,148
You need something, right?

97
00:09:11,947 --> 00:09:13,490
Thank you! Come again!

98
00:09:22,708 --> 00:09:23,834
Come on. Please.

99
00:09:24,585 --> 00:09:27,129
- No way.
- But why not?

100
00:09:27,212 --> 00:09:28,130
I said no.

101
00:09:28,964 --> 00:09:31,800
Can't you just casually give Kazehaya
some words of encouragement?! Just say

102
00:09:31,883 --> 00:09:34,761
something like, "Hey, bro, don't worry
about it, you understand Sawako one

103
00:09:34,845 --> 00:09:37,723
hundred percent!" or
something like that! Anything!

104
00:09:37,806 --> 00:09:40,684
Still no. There's no way to say that
casually and I won't say something I don't

105
00:09:40,767 --> 00:09:43,812
mean. Also, I don't want to.
- Why you have to be like thaaaaat?!

106
00:09:43,895 --> 00:09:45,397
No means no!

107
00:09:51,278 --> 00:09:54,364
Well, I guess I could
lend him an ear at least.

108
00:09:57,075 --> 00:10:00,537
Just so you know... I'm not doing this for
you. It's for Shota. I'm a little worried

109
00:10:00,621 --> 00:10:01,496
is all.

110
00:10:04,249 --> 00:10:07,753
And even if he tells me something... I won't
be sharing any of it with you. And thank

111
00:10:07,836 --> 00:10:09,463
you for this.

112
00:10:11,882 --> 00:10:12,799
Hey, wait! Ryu!

113
00:10:26,563 --> 00:10:30,817
- Thank you! You're the best!
- Shota, you aren't getting food?

114
00:10:30,901 --> 00:10:35,238
Ah, go without me. I figured I'd carry
out the tools for the parade float first.

115
00:10:35,947 --> 00:10:36,782
Sure.

116
00:10:39,785 --> 00:10:43,455
Out of everything, I'm most
excited for the black magic café!

117
00:10:43,538 --> 00:10:46,833
And we'll have Sawako's
consultation booth too.

118
00:10:48,126 --> 00:10:51,004
- Hm? What's wrong?
- I... I'm not psychic.

119
00:10:51,797 --> 00:10:57,094
So I don't know if I can actually be of
help to anyone for something like this.

120
00:10:57,177 --> 00:11:00,555
Hey, don't worry! You just have to say
whatever comes to mind and it'll work out.

121
00:11:00,639 --> 00:11:04,017
Yeah, you're pretty good
at that, you'll be okay.

122
00:11:04,101 --> 00:11:07,604
Then I'll give it all I've got!

123
00:11:24,371 --> 00:11:26,581
Maybe we can mix the shiso and
geranium... and make a tea blend.

124
00:11:26,665 --> 00:11:27,791
Sa-da-ko!

125
00:11:29,376 --> 00:11:30,252
Master!

126
00:11:33,505 --> 00:11:37,551
I wanted to have a chat
with you, so are you free?

127
00:12:00,824 --> 00:12:02,826
Shota. Hey... here.

128
00:12:05,078 --> 00:12:05,912
Kay.

129
00:12:13,754 --> 00:12:19,134
Thinking about what Chizuru was
saying... Guess I can help out a little.

130
00:12:20,761 --> 00:12:21,595
Uhh...

131
00:12:22,637 --> 00:12:23,472
Hm?

132
00:12:24,181 --> 00:12:26,183
So, do you think that you'll tell
Kuronuma the truth, or... just stay this

133
00:12:26,266 --> 00:12:27,100
way?

134
00:12:30,020 --> 00:12:31,146
Oh. Your soup...

135
00:12:31,980 --> 00:12:33,899
Huh?! What's that about?!

136
00:12:33,982 --> 00:12:36,526
Well, I was just wondering what happened.

137
00:12:42,991 --> 00:12:47,329
I don't know how to act
around her. I'm completely lost.

138
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:55,045
I never really thought about it... you know?
I just did whatever based on how I felt.

139
00:12:56,379 --> 00:13:00,425
I wasn't "just trying to be nice" or
anything like that. But, then, some of the

140
00:13:00,592 --> 00:13:04,805
things I did seemed like they
were starting to make her anxious.

141
00:13:04,888 --> 00:13:09,476
So... I figured if that was the case,
then I should just ask her about it, but...

142
00:13:09,559 --> 00:13:11,311
But you won't?

143
00:13:13,021 --> 00:13:16,441
- You think that she'd ever admit it?
- You won't?

144
00:13:16,525 --> 00:13:20,111
- See?
- Oh, if it isn't Shota!

145
00:13:20,737 --> 00:13:21,863
- Hm?
- Hm?

146
00:13:25,742 --> 00:13:30,664
What's wrong with eating
lunch in the school cafeteria?

147
00:13:30,747 --> 00:13:34,417
A lot. Ya think you
can afford to sit around?

148
00:13:35,335 --> 00:13:39,881
I think your wife's been
cheatin' on ya... with that Kento Miura.

149
00:13:48,056 --> 00:13:51,560
You're wrong. Whatever it is,
it's not my business anyway.

150
00:13:51,643 --> 00:13:53,728
Huh?... That means...

151
00:13:56,147 --> 00:13:58,859
She broke up with you?

152
00:13:59,568 --> 00:14:03,905
- I'm right, aren't I?!
- You're not!

153
00:14:07,033 --> 00:14:13,957
Wait, don't tell me... You haven't
even asked her out yet. Are you kidding?

154
00:14:15,166 --> 00:14:18,044
Come on. Shouldn't you express your love?

155
00:14:19,004 --> 00:14:23,466
Meet in a nice spot with the sun shining
down and share your feelings. Muster up

156
00:14:23,550 --> 00:14:27,846
every ounce of your puny little
maggot-like courage and proclaim your love

157
00:14:27,929 --> 00:14:30,223
for each other atop the jungle gym.

158
00:14:30,307 --> 00:14:32,642
H- How does this bastard
always find out about everything?!

159
00:14:32,726 --> 00:14:35,312
Looks like I made it.

160
00:14:35,604 --> 00:14:38,440
Now, time for some food! Oh, Ryu, you're
done eating already? -The fried rice here

161
00:14:38,523 --> 00:14:41,735
is way better than the curry, you know!
- I'm sure Kuronuma doesn't even realize

162
00:14:41,818 --> 00:14:43,194
how I feel.

163
00:14:46,364 --> 00:14:49,576
Or maybe she's anxious because she knows.

164
00:14:54,205 --> 00:15:00,795
I think they're right. I really don't
understand a single thing... about Kuronuma.

165
00:15:01,046 --> 00:15:07,761
Yeah so what does that matter? As far
as I can tell, that's pretty normal.

166
00:15:07,844 --> 00:15:11,514
Who do you think you are, kid?

167
00:15:12,349 --> 00:15:14,059
He's not wrong...

168
00:15:15,727 --> 00:15:18,939
Where did you say she was?

169
00:15:20,106 --> 00:15:21,024
Kuronuma!

170
00:15:21,566 --> 00:15:28,198
Um... Last time I saw, near a flower
bed with some weird plants grow-... Hey!

171
00:15:31,201 --> 00:15:35,038
So isn't it great, Sadako? I mean
you're totally fitting in with the class

172
00:15:35,121 --> 00:15:39,000
- now.
- Y-you really think that? Seriously?

173
00:15:44,130 --> 00:15:47,092
Could this be it... what I've always
dreamed of? To find my place among my

174
00:15:47,175 --> 00:15:48,009
peers?

175
00:15:50,679 --> 00:15:54,933
I can't believe you're just now
recognizing this. So, even if you were the

176
00:15:55,016 --> 00:15:59,688
class's outcast...
that's all in the past now.

177
00:15:59,771 --> 00:16:05,402
You don't even need Kazehaya's help! Now
you know you can do just fine on your own!

178
00:16:08,488 --> 00:16:10,115
You're not happy?

179
00:16:12,033 --> 00:16:17,497
Did you want things to stay the same
so you'd keep Kazehaya's attention?

180
00:16:20,750 --> 00:16:21,584
Uh-uh.

181
00:16:23,420 --> 00:16:26,381
Being able to fit in with my class...

182
00:16:27,716 --> 00:16:29,217
Wanna play?!

183
00:16:30,135 --> 00:16:32,637
...Was always my ultimate goal.

184
00:16:33,221 --> 00:16:34,556
Good morning.

185
00:16:35,432 --> 00:16:37,308
Something I only ever
dreamed of... But then...

186
00:16:37,392 --> 00:16:38,518
Kuronuma!

187
00:16:43,273 --> 00:16:46,943
He'd always talk to me like it was the
most normal thing... it made me forget any

188
00:16:47,027 --> 00:16:48,903
other concerns.

189
00:16:51,531 --> 00:16:57,328
You're gloomy and creep everyone out, so
it's easy for you to get his attention.

190
00:16:57,871 --> 00:17:00,874
I guess my gloominess was
the reason I got his attention...

191
00:17:00,957 --> 00:17:03,168
Yeah, that's true.

192
00:17:04,753 --> 00:17:08,465
I do feel happy, but
I'm also kinda... in shock.

193
00:17:10,592 --> 00:17:15,221
Because that was... what I
admired about Kazehaya, wasn't it?

194
00:17:15,847 --> 00:17:19,142
It makes sense that
you'd get the wrong idea...

195
00:17:20,310 --> 00:17:23,480
...with how he acted. I mean, the way he
talked to you, of course you'd get

196
00:17:23,563 --> 00:17:24,689
confused.

197
00:17:26,775 --> 00:17:30,612
What?! How does he know?! He
deserves the title Master Psychic!

198
00:17:30,695 --> 00:17:34,532
But I don't think he means to. He's
not trying to hurt you or anything.

199
00:17:34,616 --> 00:17:38,078
But either way... it's a little insensitive.

200
00:17:38,787 --> 00:17:41,664
But that's not true! You're wrong!

201
00:17:42,707 --> 00:17:47,712
Kazehaya is friendly, bright and cheerful
towards everyone! He treats people fairly!

202
00:17:47,796 --> 00:17:52,801
Me included! He'd greet me with
that warm smile of his all the time!

203
00:17:52,884 --> 00:17:56,721
When I told him my true
feelings, he believed me.

204
00:17:58,348 --> 00:18:01,643
And that's why... for the first time in my
life. I felt no distance between me and

205
00:18:01,726 --> 00:18:03,353
someone else.

206
00:18:07,065 --> 00:18:11,528
It's true. I grew to like him
simply because of who he was.

207
00:18:13,113 --> 00:18:18,451
But for some time now... I could see...
it wasn't enough for me anymore.

208
00:18:20,829 --> 00:18:24,541
And I could hardly
believe I felt like that...

209
00:18:24,624 --> 00:18:28,711
